WEBVTT

00:00:00.332 --> 00:00:02.724
Grid Bot Builder. Grid Bot Blueprint.

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:05.612
Lesson three. What is a grid bot.

00:00:06.671 --> 00:00:10.394
Education only. Not financial advice. This

00:00:10.394 --> 00:00:12.673
is general information and doesn't

00:00:12.673 --> 00:00:15.029
consider your objectives, financial

00:00:15.029 --> 00:00:18.023
situation or needs. Crypto is high risk.

00:00:18.483 --> 00:00:21.471
You could lose all the money you put in. A

00:00:21.471 --> 00:00:23.694
grid bot, in this lesson, is not a guess

00:00:23.668 --> 00:00:26.242
about next month. It is a set of limit

00:00:26.242 --> 00:00:28.713
orders waiting on rungs inside a band you

00:00:28.713 --> 00:00:32.165
already measured. The band is the summer

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.922
of 2023. The path is already on the chart.

00:00:35.382 --> 00:00:37.691
We are naming how it works. We are not

00:00:37.691 --> 00:00:40.629
saying an order traded. By the end you

00:00:40.629 --> 00:00:43.728
will be able to do three things. Define a

00:00:44.013 --> 00:00:50.303
grid as limit orders waiting inside 24930

00:00:50.303 --> 00:00:56.160
to 30331. Say which side of 27630 is the

00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:07.709
buy side in this picture. Say, in plain

00:01:07.709 --> 00:01:09.947
words, that the ten crosses are not a

00:01:09.947 --> 00:01:22.431
result. Imagine a line that only touches a

00:01:22.431 --> 00:01:24.704
rung. Touching the rung's price is a

00:01:24.704 --> 00:01:27.246
cross. An order actually trading is a

00:01:27.246 --> 00:01:29.949
fill. Those are two different things. A

00:01:29.949 --> 00:01:32.595
limit order waits at a price you chose. A

00:01:32.595 --> 00:01:35.066
market order does not wait. It trades

00:01:35.066 --> 00:01:37.233
straight away, at the prices people are

00:01:37.091 --> 00:01:39.591
already offering. That list of waiting

00:01:39.591 --> 00:01:43.055
prices is called the book. On this chart

00:01:43.378 --> 00:01:46.788
the middle rung is 27630. The daily close

00:01:46.788 --> 00:01:49.421
crossed it ten times. A cross is the price

00:01:49.421 --> 00:01:51.871
line touching that rung. A fill is an

00:01:51.871 --> 00:01:54.695
order actually trading. These ten marks

00:01:54.695 --> 00:01:57.811
are crosses, not fills. One teaching

00:01:57.811 --> 00:02:00.338
picture places buy orders below the middle

00:02:00.338 --> 00:02:05.380
and sell orders above it. Below 27630:

00:02:05.469 --> 00:02:16.345
26730, 25830, 24930. Above it: 28531,

00:02:16.602 --> 00:02:24.056
29431, 30331. When the path stepped down

00:02:24.056 --> 00:02:27.270
toward 26050 on 18 August 2023, it was on

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:30.902
the lower side of that picture. When it

00:02:30.902 --> 00:02:34.425
later printed 27969 on 7 October, it was

00:02:34.425 --> 00:02:37.744
back through the middle. If the path

00:02:37.744 --> 00:02:39.860
leaves, one side can be left holding

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:43.193
inventory. When the path left in October,

00:02:43.193 --> 00:02:46.332
that is what happened to a band that ended

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:49.387
at 30331. Here is the shape, without

00:02:49.387 --> 00:02:53.425
reading out every day. From 19 July 2023

00:02:53.425 --> 00:02:59.397
to 16 October 2023 the path stayed between

00:02:59.397 --> 00:03:04.686
24930 and 30331, and the close crossed

00:03:04.686 --> 00:03:08.742
27630 ten times. That is the path relative

00:03:08.742 --> 00:03:11.800
to the band. It is marked Example. It is

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:16.052
not a forecast. Worked check. The middle

00:03:16.226 --> 00:03:22.662
rung is 27,630. 26,050 on 18 August is

00:03:22.662 --> 00:03:29.838
below 27,630, and 27,969 on 7 October is

00:03:29.838 --> 00:03:34.202
above 27,630. The ten crosses are not a

00:03:34.202 --> 00:03:37.860
gain. Recap. A grid here means limit

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:40.167
orders waiting inside the measured band.

00:03:49.029 --> 00:03:53.727
Buys sit below 27630 in the picture. Sells

00:03:53.727 --> 00:04:04.042
sit above it. When the path left the band

00:04:04.042 --> 00:04:05.943
in October, that picture no longer

00:04:05.943 --> 00:04:18.050
applied. A crystal ball crossed out next

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:20.565
to orders waiting on a ladder of prices: a

00:04:20.565 --> 00:04:25.467
grid bot doesn't predict, it waits. A

00:04:25.467 --> 00:04:27.890
simple robot next to a ladder of price

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:30.235
lines with buy orders below and sell

00:04:30.235 --> 00:04:35.520
orders above. A chart box labelled with

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:38.128
five words: top, bottom, price steps, what

00:04:38.128 --> 00:04:42.531
you hold, and stop. An order ticket

00:04:42.531 --> 00:04:45.072
waiting on a price line. A cross is the

00:04:45.072 --> 00:04:47.696
line touching a rung. A fill is an order

00:04:47.696 --> 00:04:52.885
actually trading. Price drops down through

00:04:52.885 --> 00:04:55.054
a line, and the buy order waiting there

00:04:54.856 --> 00:05:00.062
gets filled. Price rises up through a

00:05:00.062 --> 00:05:02.175
line, and the sell order waiting there

00:05:02.065 --> 00:05:07.675
gets filled. Two jars showing that after

00:05:07.675 --> 00:05:10.021
buys you hold more of the coin and after

00:05:10.021 --> 00:05:15.674
sells you hold more cash. A robot putting

00:05:15.674 --> 00:05:18.123
order tickets back on a ladder: its job is

00:05:18.123 --> 00:05:20.275
to keep your orders waiting at your

00:05:20.275 --> 00:05:26.033
prices. A notebook sketch with five labels

00:05:26.033 --> 00:05:28.257
to point at: top, bottom, price steps,

00:05:28.257 --> 00:05:33.082
what you hold and stop. A pretend price

00:05:33.082 --> 00:05:35.819
line crossing several lines. A cross is

00:05:35.819 --> 00:05:38.298
the line touching a rung. A fill is an

00:05:38.298 --> 00:05:42.441
order actually trading. Marked Example. A

00:05:42.441 --> 00:05:44.609
common miss is to describe the bot as

00:05:44.609 --> 00:05:47.946
earning while price chops. Fills are not

00:05:47.946 --> 00:05:52.251
profits. No exchange is a partner in this

00:05:52.251 --> 00:05:57.588
definition. Orders wait inside your range.

00:05:58.048 --> 00:06:00.328
A stop is the sentence you write for when

00:06:00.265 --> 00:06:02.788
the path leaves the band. What you hold

00:06:02.788 --> 00:06:07.593
can change. A notebook sketch with the

00:06:07.593 --> 00:06:09.656
five words labelled and one step down

00:06:09.656 --> 00:06:15.145
drawn. A notebook sketch with five empty

00:06:15.145 --> 00:06:17.466
tags for you to fill in and say out loud.

00:06:20.869 --> 00:06:23.204
A notebook sketch of an order waiting on a

00:06:23.083 --> 00:06:25.196
price line until the price reaches it.

00:06:28.689 --> 00:06:31.186
Three things crossed out: a grid bot is

00:06:31.186 --> 00:06:33.683
not a signal, not a fund, and not a person

00:06:33.683 --> 00:06:39.146
watching for you. Your notebook with an

00:06:39.146 --> 00:06:41.424
arrow to the next lesson about the shapes

00:06:41.294 --> 00:06:47.335
price can make. Next lesson: Market

00:06:47.335 --> 00:06:49.670
regimes. Bring the page with the band, the

00:06:49.644 --> 00:06:52.424
gaps, and the stop sentence. Leave every

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:55.017
figure marked Example. No order is sent

00:06:54.863 --> 00:06:55.825
between lessons.

